  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a la Gestin Pblica Agropecuaria</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Agricultural Public Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El fin del Programa es mejorar la competitividad de los productores agropecuarios del Uruguay. El propsito es lograr una gestin pblica del sector agropecuario ms eficaz y eficiente.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Program is to improve the competitiveness of the agricultural producers of Uruguay. The purpose is to achieve a more effective and efficient public administration of the agricultural sector.</narrative>
  </description>
